tch09/58-df-elementary\">../batch09/58-df-elementary</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span> (signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,\\delta,U\\in V\">\\(C,\\delta,U\\in V\\)</span> (chain function, nonzero ordinal length, and union-structure candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure predicate and universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\)</span> (elementary-substructure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary\">../batch09/58-df-elementary</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Cst},\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Cst},\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> (signature-symbol families, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^M_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^M_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\">\\(I^M_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^M_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\)</span> (interpretation components, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9UnionOfElementaryChain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9UnionOfElementaryChain}_S\\)</span> (elementary-chain-union predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}union\\text{-}of\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9UnionOfElementaryChain}_S(U,C,\\delta,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\delta\\neq0\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(U,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(C(\\alpha),\\Sigma)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\delta\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(C(\\alpha),C(\\beta),\\Sigma))\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Univ}(U)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\delta}\\mathrm{Univ}(C(\\alpha))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\nI^U_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\delta}I^{C(\\alpha)}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\nI^U_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(f)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\delta}I^{C(\\alpha)}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(f)\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall c\\in\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\n\\bigl(I^U_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)=I^{C(\\alpha)}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" ta